-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §5 יישום הדרגתי בבתי הספר: in תשע"ב–תשע"ד
-- the reform is applied in some schools in full and in others in part, by
-- lists the Ministry draws up each year in consultation with the
-- organisation, and only where 75% of the school's eligible teaching
-- employees consent in writing; from תשע"ה in every school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-7`

§ `5 יישום הדרגתי בבתי הספר`

§§ `5(ב)`

@desc A teaching employee of the school, as far as §5(ב)'s count asks.
DECLARE `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5` HAS
    `qualifications`              IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
    `consented in writing to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN

-- (ב): in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, the written consent of 75% of the teaching
-- employees employed in the school who meet the conditions for the
-- reform — that is, all but those §7(ח) keeps off it — is a threshold
-- condition for applying the reform there, in full or in part. The clause
-- calls 75% a threshold ("תנאי-סף"), so 75% exactly is enough.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
GIVEN staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` staff IF
    count consenting AT LEAST 75% TIMES count eligible
    WHERE
        eligible MEANS filter (GIVEN m YIELD NOT `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (m's `qualifications`)) staff
        consenting MEANS filter (GIVEN m YIELD m's `consented in writing to the reform`) eligible

§§ `5(א)`

-- (א): the Ministry draws up, for each of the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ד,
-- the lists of the schools that apply the reform in full and in part,
-- consulting the organisation (no deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_5__para_a
DECLARE `Oz section 5 action` IS ONE OF
    `draw up the year's lists of Oz reform schools, consulting the organisation`

`drawing up the lists of reform schools` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `draw up the year's lists of Oz reform schools, consulting the organisation`

-- (א): the reform is applied gradually over תשע"ב–תשע"ד, in each school as
-- far as the year's list says, where (ב)'s threshold is met; from תשע"ה in
-- every school, and in full, for the part-time application of part ז is
-- for the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ד only (§26).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `the year's list` IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `how far the reform is applied in the school in` y `the year's list` staff IS
    BRANCH
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5775` THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5772` AND `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` staff
        THEN `the year's list`
        OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

§§ `5 -- illustrations`

GIVEN consented IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
DECIDE `a qualified staff member who` consented IS
    `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5` WITH
        `qualifications`              IS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 1 TRUE TRUE FALSE
        `consented in writing to the reform` IS consented

-- one below a third of a position, whom §7(ח) keeps off the reform and
-- the count leaves out
`a staff member at a fifth of a position` MEANS
    `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5` WITH
        `qualifications`              IS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.2 TRUE TRUE FALSE
        `consented in writing to the reform` IS FALSE

`three of four consent` MEANS
    LIST `a qualified staff member who` TRUE, `a qualified staff member who` TRUE,
         `a qualified staff member who` TRUE, `a qualified staff member who` FALSE,
         `a staff member at a fifth of a position`

`two of four consent` MEANS
    LIST `a qualified staff member who` TRUE, `a qualified staff member who` TRUE,
         `a qualified staff member who` FALSE, `a qualified staff member who` FALSE

#ASSERT `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` `three of four consent`
#ASSERT NOT `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` `two of four consent`
#ASSERT `how far the reform is applied in the school in` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in part` `three of four consent` EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT `how far the reform is applied in the school in` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in full` `two of four consent` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
#ASSERT `how far the reform is applied in the school in` `the school year 5775` `off the Oz reform` `two of four consent` EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
